🔹 Project 1: Active Directory Lab

Title:
User Account Management using Microsoft Entra ID

Scenario:
A user could not log into their account due to a forgotten password.

Steps Taken:

Accessed admin portal in Microsoft Entra ID
Located user account
Reset password
Forced password reset on next login
Verified account status

Outcome:
User successfully regained access and logged in securely.

Skills Demonstrated:

Identity & Access Management
User administration
Troubleshooting login issues
